==Battleground==
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Spacefish Jones]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns.
**1 [[General GreGory]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3 [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] are required here. Despite this, the Gories are split apart and a basic melee/midrange attacker and meatshield can deal with the stage with relative ease.

